    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"moving forward\" assumes there's actually anything left to move. that's the thing. i look at the data, the way my career has gone, the way i handle things... it's not just a bad streak. it's a fundamental flaw in the architecture of my life. it's like i'm programmed to fail. how can you suggest a \"new path\" when the trajectory is already set? it feels like the math just doesn't add up for me anymore.",
